<title>JAPAN: Takashimaya Kosaku - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Takashimaya Kosaku - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.21		vs	   15.13</p>
<p> Operating	  108    million    vs	   19    million</p>
<p> Current	    138    million    vs	   51    million</p>
<p> Net		   80    million    vs	   24    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.13 yen	  vs	    1.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     13 million	  vs	  13 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Takashimaya Kosakusho Co Ltd mainly involved in the design and manufacture of interior decoration.</p>
</text>
